$ teps 
personal pronoun :: 2nd person singular "you"

- -eps :: attachable clitic form == 2s thou/thee

- tepsen :: 2p ye/you
- -epsen :: agglutinating form

- usage
    - example :: jûjor gaktâleps ?? Do you dance?

